  "title": "Pat&#39;s Homemade Cinnamon Rolls",
  "description": "These homemade cinnamon rolls can be made the night before and baked in the morning for a moist and decadently rich breakfast treat.",
  "authors": [
    "PAT MYERS"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-12-19T11:27:40-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-10T09:20:24-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT30M",
  "cook_time": "PT25M",
  "total_time": "PT145M",
  "yield": [
    "24",
    "2 dozen"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Breakfast"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup milk",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "1 cup water",
    "1 tablespoon active dry yeast",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "2 eggs",
    "6 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "2 cups dark brown sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "2 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "1 (3 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "1 tablespoon butter, softened",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "3 tablespoons milk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Warm 1 cup of milk in a small saucepan until it just starts to bubble, then remove from heat. Add ½ cup of butter and stir until melted. Add water and let cool until lukewarm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/knoVNmIWd2rMfps-7toubRB4vh0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-01-7779c2d4269846d8b11e99a78281dac3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place lukewarm milk mixture, yeast, white sugar, salt, eggs, and 2 cups flour in a large bowl; stir well to combine. Stir in the remaining flour, 1/2 cup at a time, mixing well after each addition.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6xW5th-wyGfwRy7wJfMuqxleeoE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-02-dd7049a1c896434486904b298dbb239f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the dough has pulled together, turn it out onto a lightly floured surface and knead until smooth and elastic, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/chUQPm31e7OBLl83p-Hu2f4as_4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-03-6ec1f587aafe4c719565d344082893e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide dough into two equal pieces. Using a floured rolling pin, roll each piece into a 12x9-inch rectangle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/06_D_akp-lg8Mi8UU7hMvKCLI4E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-04-c7a0acac80dd4e29aee5b7cb141ae436.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cinnamon and brown sugar together in a bowl. Spread each piece of rolled dough with ¼ cup butter and half of the cinnamon sugar mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pGGSDojxXhcVwdz7S4JWxq0pIpA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-05-13c2523f7f2d41dd84dd1f9e60a0baab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll up dough, using a little water to seal the seam.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uyOv5CvwDA9xzcuNHq2jXGBfbuY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-06-1f8ef95fffc84b3fa1ee6b55400f4f6e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut each roll into 12 slices using a very sharp knife. Arrange rolls cut-side down onto two 9x13-inch greased baking pans. Cover with greased plastic wrap and let rise in a warm place until doubled in volume, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YUG18_InIQ5gn4x4Yp7j-NsUlLs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-07-c566ba178cf94d0dbd8735d06250d6d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake cinnamon rolls in preheated oven until golden brown, 20 to 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/foPDS7K2m8YHgqCMsa0r3hUe9EA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-09-50891709ac6c4512aa2ce76cd0156861.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the frosting: Beat confectioners sugar, softened cream cheese, 1 tablespoon softened butter, and vanilla together in a bowl. Add milk gradually until frosting reaches a spreading consistency.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wz6372V6T3uwwr_wtWgw1XvGeZc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-08-93c0aa3b653d47c8b2e26c1852d8ffb8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread frosting over warm (but not hot) cinnamon rolls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/o6Es0I28-hlat5fuBOFlsZxBOso=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-step-10-9c60fc93ee6f47ab830150c8df3485b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hvny7I5PFUntxR1-eBKUkmNIcC4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24351-cinnamon-rolls-VAT-Beauty-4x3-81fca087a43b43dcb17cf9e6b99db4e5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24351/step_12.webp"
    }
  ],
